            "content": "void setup(){\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  pinMode(4, INPUT); pinMode(5, INPUT); pinMode(6, INPUT);\n}\nvoid loop(){\n  Serial.print(\"touch=\"); Serial.print(digitalRead(4));\n  Serial.print(\",motion=\"); Serial.print(digitalRead(5));\n  Serial.print(\",hall=\"); Serial.println(digitalRead(6));\n  delay(120);\n}\n"
